00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.790
But the way lawyers go
after people's assets

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:43.770
when they're subject to court judgements,

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.750
is a fascinating process in and of itself.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.480
You go through a whole
writ of attachment process,

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:51.510
to go after an individual's
salary, bank accounts,

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.490
and assets, to satisfy the judgment.

00:15:53.490 --> 00:15:54.750
And there's a whole bunch of law on this

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:57.360
because the only thing lawyers
love more than winning a case

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.920
is getting paid.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.230
Of course, Jones has
tried to hide his assets

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.610
through his corporate entities,

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:03.450
but the bankruptcy court

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.670
was already paying very close
attention to these companies

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:07.770
because they are in bankruptcy.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.450
Infowars' parent company,
Free Speech Systems,

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.283
is being monitored

00:16:10.283 --> 00:16:12.510
by the Department of
Justice-appointed trustee,

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:16.500
so when he hawks colloidal
silver male horse vitality pills,

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:17.333
or whatever,

00:16:17.333 --> 00:16:18.960
that's going to go to
the corporate entities,

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.090
and it stands a good chance
of going to the plaintiffs

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:24.270
before it ever goes to Jones himself.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:26.310
The plaintiffs in Texas and Connecticut

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:28.260
will be debtors in the bankruptcy estate,

00:16:28.260 --> 00:16:30.210
and they'll try to get
as much as they can.

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.680
Lawyers are very good at that,

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.540
and the court is watching.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.340
So things are bad for Alex Jones,

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.750
